{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*vъzdьlě}}. Compare {{cog|pl|wedle}} and {{cog|cs|vedle}} from {{cog|sla-pro|*vъdьlě}}, as well as {{m|ru|по́дле}} from {{cog|sla-pro|*podьlě}}. Syntactically, {{m|ru|воз-}} + an element related to {{m|ru|длина́|t=length}}.

